+/**
+ * Single source of truth for every localStorage key this app uses.
+ *
+ * Before this file existed, each of these ~72 keys was a raw string
+ * literal typed out separately everywhere it was read or written --
+ * across 8+ files -- with no single place to see the full list or
+ * catch a typo (a single mistyped character silently creates a second,
+ * disconnected storage slot instead of erroring). Import STORAGE_KEYS
+ * and reference a property instead of typing the string again.
+ *
+ * The property names are new; the string VALUES are unchanged from
+ * before, so existing persisted data in a person's browser is read
+ * exactly as before -- this is a pure refactor, not a data migration.
+ */
